 purchasing desk for twelve years and keeps the quiet spares of the yard in Shadow Dock off the books.","motivation":"She believes that keeping spare hulls hidden keeps the yard solvent and protects the jobs of hundreds of riggers.","goal":"Keep the hull in Shadow Dock off the ledger and discredit Maren before the auditors arrive.","flaw":"She is convinced that her intentions excuse her methods, so she cannot see her deceptions as harmful.","internal_conflict":"She sincerely believes she is protecting the yard, yet each cover-up requires harming the riggers she claims to protect.","external_conflict":"The Charter Audit Office is days from arrival and Maren's power trace could expose her hidden spares.","arc":"Varga starts out as a composed manager who hides spares for the yard's sake. She orders the Shadow Dock power cut, and that act puts Maren's heat budget at risk and exposes the hull's thermal signature. When it fails she gives the auditors a full accounting, ending the story as someone who must answer for her choices.","personality_traits":["composed","paternalistic","strategic","polite"],"abilities":[{"name":"Ledger Manipulation","description":"She reroutes mass entries through scrap purchase records so unlogged hulls look scrapped.","category":"social"},{"name":"Shadow Dock Access","description":"She holds the berthing keys and survey blind-spot schedules for the eclipsed dock.","category":"other"}],"home_location_id":"loc_shadow_dock","faction_id":"fac_helio_tank"},{"id":"chr_dov_Auditor_placeholder","name":"Placeholder","role":"supporting","description":"x","motivation":"x","goal":"x","flaw":"x","internal_conflict":"x","external_conflict":"x","arc":"x","home_location_id":"loc_bastion_hulk"}],"relationships":[]}
