e is crooked, but fears losing the Kin's goodwill and the wains that carry his stock.","external_conflict":"The Round is divided over the lease, and the favour shortage makes every member guard their own debts.","arc":"Bramble begins by joking away rumours about the sale. When Marrow's contest forces the Round to vote openly, he must break the tie himself. He votes to hear both claims in full and ends as a Round speaker who names problems early.","personality_traits":["jovial","generous","evasive","gossipy"],"abilities":[{"name":"Crowd-calming","description":"Defuses heated arguments with humour and a well-timed pot of tea.","category":"social"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_marrow_oswin_claim","source_character_id":"chr_marrow_fennick","target_character_id":"chr_oswin_carter","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Marrow Fennick and Oswin Carter are rivals over the Ninth Stall's lease; she holds the family claim while he is quietly selling it, so each stands in the other's way."},{"id":"rel_oswin_marrow_guilt","source_character_id":"chr_oswin_carter","target_character_id":"chr_marrow_fennick","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Oswin Carter privately respects Marrow Fennick's persistence but sees her claim as the one obstacle to the Kin's survival, so he delays and deflects her."},{"id":"rel_tamsin_marrow_ally","source_character_id":"chr_tamsin_wick","target_character_id":"chr_marrow_fennick","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Tamsin Wick quietly helps Marrow Fennick search the wishing tags, and their bargain forces Marrow to accept help while Tamsin risks her standing with the senior tallykeepers."},{"id":"rel_bramble_marrow_friend","source_character_id":"chr_bramble_hobb","target_character_id":"chr_marrow_fennick","relationship_type":"friend","description":"Bramble Hobb is an old trading friend of Marrow Fennick, but his reluctance to take sides strains their friendship as the Round's vote nears."},{"id":"rel_bramble_oswin_trade","source_charac